      "created_at": "2013-04-08T20:32:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Tempest, The Visionary, and Mr. Fixer fighting La Capitán in the Block.</p><p>Block had Char, two Imprisoned Rogues, and a Defensive Displacement out, but thanks to a Prison Riot earlier burning most of the cards in the deck, Mr. Fixer correctly predicted the Displacement and got Riveting Crane to hit La Capitán (and Siege-Breaker, that turn) to remove their DR. The Visionary, for her part, played Wrest the Mind on Char.</p><p>\"I could have hit 56 damage, no sweat\" is usually not a thing you hear in this game.</p>",
