      "created_at": "2013-04-10T00:23:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Once had a plumeting monorail take out the last of The Enead.&nbsp; One hero was at seven, Geb (I think) was at 5, and the remaining 3 heroes were below that.&nbsp; I think Ra could have taken him out, but the image of an Egyptian God disappearing Looney Tunes-style under a train like was too fun not to let happen.</p>",
