    {
      "id": 59196,
      "name": "flamethrower49",
      "username": "flamethrower49",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-11T03:12:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Kalir\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/f0a364/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Kalir:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Tempest, The Visionary, and Mr. Fixer fighting La Capitán in the Block.Block had Char, two Imprisoned Rogues, and a Defensive Displacement out, but thanks to a Prison Riot earlier burning most of the cards in the deck, Mr. Fixer correctly predicted the Displacement and got Riveting Crane to hit La Capitán (and Siege-Breaker, that turn) to remove their DR. The Visionary, for her part, played Wrest the Mind on Char.\"I could have hit 56 damage, no sweat\" is usually not a thing you hear in this game.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This may be the best thing ever.</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:34:55.687Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
