      "raw": "[quote=\"Kalir\"]\n Tempest, The Visionary, and Mr. Fixer fighting La Capitán in the Block.Block had Char, two Imprisoned Rogues, and a Defensive Displacement out, but thanks to a Prison Riot earlier burning most of the cards in the deck, Mr. Fixer correctly predicted the Displacement and got Riveting Crane to hit La Capitán (and Siege-Breaker, that turn) to remove their DR. The Visionary, for her part, played Wrest the Mind on Char.&quot;I could have hit 56 damage, no sweat&quot; is usually not a thing you hear in this game.  \n[/quote]\n \n\n This may be the best thing ever. \n",
