    {
      "id": 59198,
      "name": "celette482",
      "username": "celette482",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/a5b964/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-13T23:13:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have to tell this story because though it isn't death BY environment, it is survival by environment.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Google+ crowd just played Iron Legacy at Wagner Mars Base (bet you can see where this is going)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Heroes: Grandpa Legacy, Nightmist, Bunker, Visionary, Eternal Haka</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2 rounds and we're all still alive but below 5HP each.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>THEN COMES METEOR STORM (and another, just for good measure)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Cue waiting for eight (count 'em, eight) rounds while we get out ongoing destruction, omni cannon charges up, and we do a bit of healing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Grandpa Legacy and nightmist skip their turns and Bunker wastes IL for 38ish damage. Done, son.</p>",
